<title>USA: Morgan Guaranty sets $300 mln senior notes.</title>
<headline>Morgan Guaranty sets $300 mln senior notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Thursday, said lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER MORGAN GUARANTY UNIT OF J.P. MORGAN &amp; CO INC</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 6.00 PCT   MATURITY 10/01/1998</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  PAY DATE 04/01/97 LAST MOODY AA1     SPREAD N.A.	 PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AAA	 YIELD 6.00 PCT    CALLABLE NO</p>
</text>
